DESCRIPTION:No one combines stand-up comedy\, improvised music\, and audien
 ce interaction like Chris Turner. This unique skillset proved a hit with th
 e American public\, who voted him runner-up on Season 20 of America’s Got
  Talent \, making him the highest-placed comedian in 10 years and the top-r
 anking rapper the show has ever seen.\n\nChris was one of the first comedia
 ns to ever perform a Las Vegas residency with Cirque Du Soleil \; defeated 
 ChatGPT in TED’ s inaugural Man vs. Machine rap battle\; and his appearan
 ces on America’s Got Talent and The Late Show with Stephen Colbert earned
  him rapturous standing ovations. Based in New York\, he’s a regular head
 line act at the world-famous Comedy Cellar\, with over 125 million views on
 line thanks to his unmatched improvisational talent. Chris’s one-of-a-kin
 d approach to crowd-sourced musical comedy makes his live shows a unique an
 d unforgettable experience that has to be seen to be believed.\n\n”Absolu
 tely hilarious…Brilliant. Brilliant. Brilliant” – Simon Cowell\n\n“
 One of the most unique and innovative acts ever…genuinely has to be seen 
